  "content": "<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1154/725/berserker_mod_banner-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1623\"></h1><h1>🪓化身狂戰士，進入野性狂暴的戰鬥狀態！</h1><hr><h2>📂 安裝說明</h2><hr><p><strong>🚨必裝模組</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" rel=\"nofollow\">法術引擎 (Spell Engine)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-rpg-classes\" rel=\"nofollow\">更多RPG職業 (More RPG Classes)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azurelib-armor\" rel=\"nofollow\">蔚藍護甲庫 (Azure Lib Armor)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p><strong>👍強烈推薦模組</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/witcher-rpg-class\" rel=\"nofollow\">巫師 (Witcher)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcemaster-rpg-class\" rel=\"nofollow\">原力大師 (Forcemaster)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/elemental-wizards-rpg-class\" rel=\"nofollow\">元素巫師 (Elemental Wizards)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-rpg-jewelry\" rel=\"nofollow\">RPG額外飾品 (Additional RPG Jewelry)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的戰鬥 (Better Combat)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daedelus_dev/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">全套RPG系列模組 (The whole RPG Series Project)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>🤝<strong>相容模組</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/environmentz\" rel=\"nofollow\">環境影響 (EnviromentZ)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/frostiful\" rel=\"nofollow\">霜寒之境 (Frostiful)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的終界 (BetterEnd)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">更好的地獄 (BetterNether)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zephyr\" rel=\"nofollow\">西風 (Zephyr)</a> 感謝MuonR的相容性支援！</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>🕹️ 特色內容</h2><h3>✨法術系統</h3><ul>\n<li>運用全新狂戰士技能，讓戰鬥更加刺激</li>\n<li>裝備綁定法術池的咒術書或綁定法術的武器即可施放技能</li>\n<li>合成咒術書需先找到法術綁定台或自行製作，並準備一本書</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/848/804/berserker_spell_binding.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"505\"></p><h3>🤺戰鬥與裝備</h3><ul>\n<li>打造狂戰士專屬斧類武器與護甲，也可在寶箱中發現</li>\n<li>狂戰士專精高爆發近戰物理傷害</li>\n<li>裝備附帶「狂暴」屬性：血量越低造成傷害越高！</li>\n<li>部分特殊武器僅能透過寶箱獲取</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/832/898/berserker_showcase.png\" alt=\"Berserker\" width=\"960\" height=\"505\"></p><h2>⚙️設定檔</h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>護甲與武器加成：</li>\n<li><em>config/berserker_rpg/items.json</em></li>\n<li>戰利品注入設定：</li>\n<li><em>config/rpg_series/loot.json</em></li>\n<li><em>狀態效果：</em></li>\n<li><em>config/berserker_rpg/effects.json</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><h2>🎥 實機展示</h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>感謝所有創作者展示本模組😊！</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NXNDYmtoJIM?t=3s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tuknng9tjYg?t=274s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div><hr><h1><strong>🙌製作群</strong></h1><ul>\n<li>感謝Deadelus開發驚人的法術引擎API</li>\n<li>感謝Damienbrittan設計超酷模組橫幅！</li>\n</ul><p>歡迎加入Discord伺服器交流模組心得！</p><h3><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AShKd5XrTu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1209063880790376468?style=plastic&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=blue&amp;link=https://discord.gg/AShKd5XrTu\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\"></a></h3>",
